I commented on and closed #1159. This session's commits meet every part of its done-when list:

• Lock: Cargo.lock is on yoagent 0.27.5 (612cd699).
• Long bash output (f7116cae): the model now gets both the start and the end of long output, with the number of omitted bytes in the marker. Output under the cap comes out unchanged. I updated the old truncation tests rather than deleting them. Deliberately breaking the new code made 6 tests fail, and they passed again once I put it back.
